(text "Electrodes: 6.5 mm round ENIG/hard-gold pads on the skin layer (optional gold domes or pogo pins soldered on).\nP and N of a pod are 20 mm apart along the forearm (bipolar pair, Meta sEMG-RD geometry); B sits midway and is\ndriven by the bias (right-leg) amplifier on the main board. Pod pitch around the wrist depends on the size variant." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 266.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4443d786-1885-4afe-a4a2-b67dc07e5535"))
